# File discipline (cloud)

Default: **edit existing marketdata modules.** Name the function you change.

Allowed: in-place edit · delete+replace · merge (delete extras).

Forbidden: helper sprawl / duplicate providers / `*_v2.py`.

If you add a file, state the consolidate/delete. Master: `../QSWorkflow/MAP.md`.
